{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027052104890-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027111728\"/><p>南亞兵團內訌毆傷同鄉。昨晚(26日)10時許，一名持「行街紙」的28歲孟加拉籍男子，途經上海街124號對開時，突被數名素有積怨的同鄉持木棍襲擊，事主猝不及防，手指及腿部受傷。兇徒得逞後，登上一輛接應的私家車絕塵而去。事主清醒由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p>警員到場經初步調查，將案件列為「襲擊致造成身體傷害」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:21:38.968581+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T21:21:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:18:15.944963+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:18:59.744979+00:00","content_hash":"14eadce78cb6523e331b4d96d1f2fa4b52770c712e7fca53e521d1555b6a5aca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:21:38.968581+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}